# wip238: a voice (track) keeps at most 3 lanes (p-locked / recorded knobs) in a pattern: the 4th is refused, other tracks are free.
wait 300
tapkey w4
tap ENV
key w4 down
spin K1 1
spin K2 10
spin K3 10
key w4 up
expect lanes 3
# the 4th knob of the same track: refused (a knob that has a lane still takes more steps)
spin K4 10
key w4 down
spin K4 10
key w4 up
expect lanes 3
key w4 down
spin K1 1
key w4 up
tapkey w5
key w5 down
spin K1 1
key w5 up
expect lanes 3
expect laneval0.0.0.5 >-1
# another track: free again
tapkey b1
key w4 down
spin K1 1
spin K2 10
spin K3 10
spin K4 10
key w4 up
expect lanes 6
